== Effects ==
* Once activated, all tears in the air split into 6 more tears in all directions, which retain their damage and shot speed.
** Luck-based effects from items such as {{i|Tough Love}} or {{i|Holy Light}} are applied individually to each tear.

== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} The item only costs 10 coins when found in a {{r|Shop}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Akeldama}}: Will bust tears generated by Akeldama into Isaac's current tears.
* {{i|Angelic Prism}}: Tears that are split by the prism can be split again by Tear Detonator.
* {{i|Anti-Gravity}}: All tears currently floating in the air will be multiplied, resulting in a massive amount of tears.
* {{C|Bethany}}/{{C|Tainted Bethany}}: Bethany can use Tear Detonator multiple times in rapid succession at the cost of one Soul/Blood Charge per use, allowing for a huge area of effect that wipes out most rooms.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps on the middle ring. The wisps' tears are also detonated into 6 tears; the resulting tears are based on Isaac's own, rather than the wisps'. Created wisps trigger Tear Detonator's effect when destroyed. Despite Tear Detonator having a timed recharge, the wisps persist between rooms.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Splits tears twice, creating 36 tears for every tear currently airborne.
** {{i|The Battery}}: Allows for multiple uses, creating tear counts in the hundreds.
* {{i|Circle of Protection}} / {{i|Metal Plate}}: Reflected tears can be split.
* {{i|Compound Fracture}}/{{i|Cricket's Body}}/{{i|The Parasite}}: Tears that are split can split again into burst tears.
* {{i|Eye of the Occult}}: Split tears form a circle around the original tear's position, and can be controlled as normal.
* {{i|Haemolacria}}: Splits tears into 6 Haemolacria tears that burst into split tears. If split tears are burst, all of them will split into 6 Haemolacria tears creating an enormous amount of tears when the main tear splits again.
* {{i|Hushy|r+}}: All 8 projectiles shot by Hushy will split and become Isaac's tears, gaining their effects.
* {{i|Ipecac}}: All tears will split into 6 explosive tears, making it very powerful (but also dangerous unless Isaac has {{i|Host Hat|n}} or {{i|Pyromaniac}}).
* {{i|Lachryphagy}}: Similar to the Haemolacria synergy, if the main tear splits, 6 tears will spawn that can be fed. However, if burst tears are split, all burst tears will split into 6 tears resulting in an enormous amount of tears that are likely to feed each other.
* {{I|Lead Pencil}}: Each of the tears explodes into 6 smaller tears.
* {{i|The Ludovico Technique}}: The tear explodes into six smaller tears, then reappears next to the player.
* {{i|My Reflection}}: The shrapnel tears will curve back to the location of the original detonated tear.
* {{i|Sad Bombs}}: Bomb tears are multiplied.
* {{i|Saturnus}}: Orbiting tears can be split, including enemy tears caught in the orbit.
* [[Shooting familiar]]s: Shooting familiars' tears explode into Isaac's tears, with his actual damage and effects.
* {{I|Technology Zero}}: Tears generated by Tear Detonator can be connected with electric charges.
** '''Technology Zero''' + {{I|Mucormycosis}} / {{I|Sinus Infection}}: Spores/Boogers generated by Tear Detonator can be connected with electric charges.
* {{i|Tiny Planet}}: Tears split, and then orbit around where the tear was originally from, three spinning clockwise, three counterclockwise.
* {{i|Trisagion}}: Tears split into six beams.
* {{i|Uranus}}: Tears shot out from frozen enemies when they are destroyed can be split.
* {{i|Urn of Souls}}: Each flame splits into six tears, unlike other fire effects.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|C Section}}: Fetuses split into normal tears.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Chocolate Milk}}: No matter how charged the tears are, split tears always deal a tiny amount of damage.
** {{dlc|r}} Split tears always deal Isaac's damage.
* {{i|Explosivo}}: Tears that are stuck to enemies will not deal explosion damage; tears released by it may be sticky tears that immediately stick back onto the enemy.

== No Effect ==
Tear Detonator becomes useless with the following, barring other sources of tears:
* {{C|Azazel}}
* [[Blindfolded]]
* {{i|Brimstone}}
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}
* {{i|Epic Fetus}}
* {{i|Mom's Knife}}
* {{i|Tech X}}
* {{i|Technology}}
* {{i|Technology 2}} (laser only)

